<title>SWITZERLAND: Roche says acquiring Boehringer Mannheim.</title>
<headline>Roche says acquiring Boehringer Mannheim.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss pharmaceuticals group Roche Holding Ltd said it had entered into an agreement with the owners of Corange Ltc, in Bermuda, to purchase Boehringer Mannheim Group.</p>
<p>It said the move would make Roche the market leader in the global diagnostics business.</p>
<p>&quot;The purchase price is still subject to adjustments, but the value of the transaction is expected to be around $11 billion U.S. The acquisition has still be to approved by the relevant regulatory authorities,&quot; Roche said in a statement.</p>
</text>
